  "transformedHtml": "<article class=\"legal-article\" id=\"art-1\">\n  <header class=\"article-header\">\n    <h2 class=\"article-number\">Article 1</h2>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"article-content\">\n    <div class=\"article-text\">\n      <p class=\"intro-text\">Dans la loi du 18 décembre 2006 modifiant les articles 80, 259quater, 259quinquies, 259nonies, 259decies, 259undecies, 323bis, 340, 341, 346 et 359 du Code judiciaire, rétablissant dans celui-ci l'article 324 et modifiant les articles 43 et 43quater de la loi du 15 juin 1935 concernant l'emploi des langues en matière judiciaire, entrent en vigueur le 1er mai 2007 :</p>\n      <ul class=\"hyphenated-items\">\n        <li class=\"hyphenated-item\">\n          <span class=\"item-text\">l'article 3, </span>\n          <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\"></span></li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"4°\"><span class=\"provision-text\"></span></li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"10°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">et </span></li>\n          </ol>\n          <span class=\"item-text\">;</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"hyphenated-item\">\n          <span class=\"item-text\">l'article 8,</span>\n          <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\"><span class=\"provision-text\"></span></li>\n          </ol>\n          <span class=\"item-text\">;</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"hyphenated-item\"><span class=\"item-text\">l'article 14;</span></li>\n        <li class=\"hyphenated-item\"><span class=\"item-text\">l'article 16;</span></li>\n        <li class=\"hyphenated-item\">\n          <span class=\"item-text\">l'(article 18, alinéa 1er). </span>\n          <span class=\"legal-citation legal-citation-standard\" data-dossier-number=\"06-03-2007\" data-law-type=\"Erratum\" data-article-number=\"10921\">Erratum, voir M.B. 06-